#: ../../source/concepts.md:217
msgid ""
"Three planets forming trines with each other (equilateral triangle of 120°)."
msgstr ""
"Trois planètes formant des trigones entre elles (triangle équilatéral de "
"120°)."

#: ../../source/concepts.md:219
msgid "T-Square"
msgstr "### T-Carré"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:221
msgid ""
"Two planets in opposition (180°), both square (90°) to a third planet "
"(apex)."
msgstr ""
"Deux planètes en opposition (180°), toutes deux en carré (90°) à une "
"troisième planète (apex)."

#: ../../source/concepts.md:223
msgid "Yod (Finger of God)"
msgstr "### Yod (Doigt de Dieu)"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:225
