"troisième planète (apex)."

#: ../../source/concepts.md:227
msgid "Grand Square"
msgstr "### Grand Carré"

#: ../../source/concepts.md:229
msgid ""
"Four planets forming four squares (90°) and two oppositions (180°), creating"
" a square in the chart."
msgstr ""
"Quatre planètes formant quatre carrés (90°) et deux oppositions (180°), "
"créant un carré dans le thème."

